<title>USA: Cb Commercial sees Koll merger hurting Q3.</title>
<headline>Cb Commercial sees Koll merger hurting Q3.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>CB Commercial Real Estate Services Group Inc said Tuesday it expects charges from its Koll Real Estate Services merger will reduce earnings for the third quarter by &quot;a slightly higher range&quot; of up to $18 million to $20 million.</p>
<p>The company said it expects the merger to be accretive on an annual basis after that.</p>
<p>The company reported earnings per share for the second quarter of $0.27 on a fully diluted basis compared with $0.16 per share for the same period a year ago.</p>
</text>
